# MODULE trusted BF tool interpreter with direct dispatch and combination handling
# AUTHOR Clive Gifford December two thousand six second implementation
# CREDIT input parser by Daniel B Cristofani and Oleg Mazonka
# INPUT normalized admitted BF tool source then bang then binary guest input
# OUTPUT exact guest bytes with no added completion or error authority
# TAPE paired instruction records and paired data records owned by original algorithm
# PRECONDITION wrapping byte root with zero EOF and balanced trusted source
# PRECONDITION at most two hundred fifty five source nesting levels and no left underflow
# LIMITATION external process watchdog and physical closure remain required
# OWNERSHIP original third party source and dates retained in plan and evidence
# ADAPTATION only safe annotations whitespace and line breaks
